    year:  A year (e.g., 2018). Must be an `int`.
    month: A month (1 <= month <= 12) in year. Must be an `int`.
    day:   A day (1 <= day <= 31, or 30, or 29, or 28) in month. Must be an
      `int`.

  Returns:
